WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.966
Ask any environmental inspector what the job is, and you will hear the same three words.

00:00:05.966 --> 00:00:11.293
Observe and report. See what happened, get it on the record, and be able to prove it.

00:00:11.293 --> 00:00:14.490
GroundLog is the field notebook built for that job.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.942
This is one working day. Morning to sign off.

00:00:17.942 --> 00:00:22.780
Everything you are about to see is the app as it ships, on a demo project.
